{#
  MANAS Status Panel - Full Cognitive Transparency

  OPUS-083: Shows what MANAS has been thinking and doing.
  This panel reads DIRECTLY from .opus_state/manas_intents.json
  so it works even when the kernel isn't actively running.

  THE TRANSPARENCY PRINCIPLE:
  - Show ALL pending intents (not just when kernel runs)
  - Show execution history
  - Show harness health (self-healing metrics)
  - Show last activity timestamps

  Required context:
    - manas_status: Dict with:
        - online: bool (kernel actively running MANAS)
        - intent_buffer:
            - pending: List of intent dicts
            - executed: List of executed intents
            - rejected: List of rejected intents
            - total_pending: int
            - last_updated: timestamp string
        - harness_health:
            - total_files: int
            - with_harness: int
            - coverage_percent: float
            - broken_files: List[str]
            - sanskrit_missing: List[str]
        - last_thought: timestamp or null
        - uptime_hours: float or null
#}

